  "regla": "Some nouns are plural in English but singular in Spanish (people → la gente, clothes → la ropa, police → la policía), and some are singular in English but usually plural in Spanish (news → las noticias, furniture → los muebles, advice → los consejos). The verb and adjectives follow the Spanish noun.",
