        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**La gente** is **singular** and **feminine**: **la gente es amable**, never _son amables_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Words for groups (**la familia, el equipo, el público, la policía**) are singular too: **mi familia vive aquí**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "For one piece, Spanish just uses the singular: **una noticia** (_a piece of news_), **un consejo** (_a piece of advice_), **un mueble** (_a piece of furniture_)."
        }
      ]
    },
